Z||000004||JB||11-15-2001||08:07 PM||||I have seen the carrera gt kit in magazines and it does look identical to the real deal.  I was hoping that someone in this forum had done the rebody so I could trade notes with them.  I have an 88 fiero (as well as an 87 and an 85gt) that I plan to put the body panels off of my 73 porsche 911 onto because my porsche chassis and pans are rust buckets!  I will be using the windshield from the fiero in convertible form .  The only hurdle is that the fiero is seven inches wider!!!!  Believe it or not the cars are almost identical in every other measurement including wheelbase.  If any one knows of any pics of fiero/porsche's, please let me know.  ||||reg||1
